  {
    "id": "31",
    "title": "Visualization 动图画廊",
    "slug": "visualization",
    "content": "欧拉恒等式的解释\r\nEuler's equation\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-34\" src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/euler.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"384\" />\r\n\r\n傅立叶变换的解释\r\nFourier transform\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-35\" src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/fourier.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"420\" />\r\n\r\n矩阵的对角化\r\nDiagonalization of matrix\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-33\" src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Diagonal.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" />\r\n\r\n矩阵奇异值分解\r\nSingular value decomposition\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-40\" src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/SVD.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"338\" />\r\n\r\n茹科夫斯基变换\r\nJoukowsky transform\r\n<img src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/joukozsky.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"388\" height=\"288\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-36\" />\r\n\r\n三维应力摩尔圆\r\nMohr's circle in 3D\r\n<img src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/mohr.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"384\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-39\" />\r\n\r\n水跃的模拟 软件Algodoo\r\nHydraulic jump (Software: Algodoo)\r\n<img src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/water1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"562\" height=\"509\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-41\" />\r\n\r\n文丘里管\r\nVenturi tube\r\n<img src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/water2.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"562\" height=\"509\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-51\" />\r\n\r\n沿程水头损失\r\nFrictional head loss\r\n<img src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/water3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"562\" height=\"509\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-52\" />\r\n\r\n层流\r\nLaminar flow\r\n<img src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/water4.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"550\" height=\"504\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-53\" />\r\n\r\n"
