  {
    "id": "68",
    "title": "2D Physics Sandbox 物理沙盒",
    "slug": "2d-physics-sandbox",
    "content": "物理沙盒，C++课程大作业 / My 2D Physics Sandbox, a project for C++ course in ENPC.\r\nGithub: <a href=\"https://github.com/flm8620/RigidBody\">https://github.com/flm8620/RigidBody</a>\r\nPart of code is based on Box2D\r\nHow does it look like:\r\n蓝线表示碰撞求解，红线表示力求解\r\nBlue vectors indicate collision solver, red vectors indicates contact solver\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-32\" src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/angrybird.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-173\" src=\"http://lemanfeng.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/angrybird2.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"786\" height=\"787\" />"
  },
